{"suttaId":"an10.187","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[1422,1423],"vripara":"187"},"segments":{"an10.187:0.3":"Dukkhudrayasuttaṃ","an10.187:1.1":"“Dukkhudrayañca vo, bhikkhave, dhammaṃ desessāmi sukhudrayañca.","an10.187:1.2":"Taṃ suṇātha…pe…","an10.187:1.3":"katamo ca, bhikkhave, dukkhudrayo dhammo?","an10.187:1.4":"Pāṇātipāto…pe…","an10.187:1.5":"micchādiṭṭhi –","an10.187:1.6":"ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, dukkhudrayo dhammo.","an10.187:2.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, sukhudrayo dhammo?","an10.187:2.2":"Pāṇātipātā veramaṇī…pe…","an10.187:2.3":"sammādiṭṭhi –","an10.187:2.4":"ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, sukhudrayo dhammo”ti.","an10.187:2.5":"Dasamaṃ. 11."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":null,"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":765,"to":769,"paras":[{"para":765,"vripara":"167-210","refs":["an10.187:1"],"lines":["Dutiye ca paṭhamādīni uttānatthāni.","Dasame <b>pacchābhūmivāsino</b>ti paccantadesavāsino.","<b>Sevālamālikā</b>ti pātova udakaṃ orohitvā sevālañceva uppalādīni ca gahetvā attano udakasuddhikabhāvajānanatthañceva “lokassa ca udakena suddhi hotī”ti imassa atthassa jānanatthañca mālaṃ katvā pilandhanakā.","<b>Udakorohakā</b>ti pāto majjhanhe sāyanhe ca udakaorohaṇakā.","Tenāha <b>“sāyatatiyakaṃ udakorohaṇānuyogamanuyuttā”</b>ti.","Ekādasamādīni uttānatthāni.","Catutthe paṇṇāsake natthi vattabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"],["an10.187:1"]]},{"para":766,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.187:1"],"lines":["Brāhmaṇapaccorohaṇīsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an10.187:1"]]},{"para":767,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.187:1"],"lines":["Catutthapaṇṇāsakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. (21) 1."],"lineRefs":[["an10.187:1"]]},{"para":768,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.187:1"],"lines":["Karajakāyavaggo 1-536."],"lineRefs":[["an10.187:1"]]},{"para":769,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.187:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamanirayasag